FormattingPolicy.Validate(safe,"volume-identity","BORRAR E:","E:","exFAT");Assert(true,"format guard accepts exact confirmation for eligible data volume");Denied(safe,typed:"BORRAR D:");Denied(safe,fs:"FAT32");Denied(safe,expected:"changed-volume");Denied(safe with{IsBoot=true});Denied(safe with{IsSystem=true});Denied(safe with{IsReadOnly=true});Denied(safe with{IsOffline=true});Denied(safe with{HasPageFile=true});Denied(safe with{ProtectedDisk=true});Denied(safe with{DataPartition=false});Denied(safe with{DiskId=""});
